flowchart TB
    %% Diagrama de capas - Clean Architecture (frontend Arrow Maze).
    %% Las flechas van de afuera hacia adentro (las capas externas dependen
    %% de las internas, nunca al reves) - Regla de Dependencia respetada.
    subgraph L4["Capa 4 - Presentation"]
        direction TB
        UI["Pantallas y controladores (ChangeNotifier): home, seleccion de nivel,
        juego, victoria, derrota, auth, leaderboard, ajustes"]
    end
    subgraph L3["Capa 3 - Infrastructure e Interface Adapters"]
        direction TB
        Adapters["lib/interface_adapters: LevelDtoMapper, PlayerProgressJsonMapper"]
        Infra["lib/infrastructure: clientes HTTP, repositorios SharedPreferences, audio"]
    end
    subgraph L2["Capa 2 - Application"]
        direction TB
        UseCases["LoadLevels, StartGame, FireArrow, RecordVictory,
        SyncPendingProgress, PullRemoteProgress, Login/Register/Logout"]
    end
    subgraph L1["Capa 1 - Domain"]
        direction TB
        Entities["Board, Game, Level, Player, PlayerProgress (bounded contexts)"]
    end

    L4 -->|depende de| L3
    L3 -->|depende de| L2
    L2 -->|depende de| L1

    classDef domain fill:#e8f4ea,stroke:#2e7d32
    classDef app fill:#e8eef8,stroke:#1565c0
    classDef adapters fill:#fdf3e2,stroke:#ef6c00
    classDef presentation fill:#f8e8ee,stroke:#ad1457
    class Entities domain
    class UseCases app
    class Adapters,Infra adapters
    class UI presentation
